ided into five columns detailing \\\"31g PROTEIN\\\", \\\"15.4g EAA\\\", \\\"7.1g BCAA\\\", either \\\"1.4g CARBS\\\" or \\\"<1g CARBS\\\" depending on the packaging size, and \\\"4B CFU PROBIOTICS\\\", with a lower sub-bar reading \\\"Whey Protein Isolate with Natural Digestive Enzymes & Probiotics.\\\" A circular \\\"HORMONE FREE\\\" seal with a line-art cow head sits to the right of this grid, while the very bottom edge features a green vegetarian dot symbol, the word \\\"NUTRACEUTICAL\\\" (or \\\"NUTRACEUTICAL FOR ADULTS\\\"), and the net weight (labeled as either \\\"1 kg (2.2 lb)\\\" or \\\"2KG (4.4LB)\\\"). The dry product inside is a finely milled, loose, off-white to pale cream-colored powder.\",\"referenceImageUrls\":[\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/a283cc61-8138-4e74-8189-32554920ab0b/1786870549944-a985ed83-af31-4505-9597-2040e34b2d43.jpg\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/a283cc61-8138-4e74-8189-32554920ab0b/1786870549958-a5cf5ca2-30b7-4a27-a29f-4498803081c8.jpg\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/a283cc61-8138-4e74-8189-32554920ab0b/1786870550234-77fd6628-1c8d-4097-a145-b5f729a36ee3.jpg\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/a283cc61-8138-4e74-8189-32554920ab0b/1786870550216-ed6397c1-1360-44e7-bed7-7085cf446c29.jpg\"],\"referenceAdImageUrls\":[],\"originalReferenceImageUrls\":[\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/a283cc61-8138-4e74-8189-32554920ab0b/1786870549944-a985ed83-af31-4505-9597-2040e34b2d43.jpg\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/a283cc61-8138-4e74-8189-32554920ab0b/1786870549958-a5cf5ca2-30b7-4a27-a29f-4498803081c8.jpg\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/a283cc61-8138-4e74-8189-32554920ab0b/1786870550234-77fd6628-1c8d-4097-a145-b5f729a36ee3.jpg\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/a283cc61-8138-4e74-8189-32554920ab0b/1786870550216-ed6397c1-1360-44e7-bed7-7085cf446c29.jpg\"]},\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-16T09:01:19.122Z\",\"variations