, either \\\"1.4g CARBS\\\" or \\\"<1g CARBS\\\" depending on the packaging size, and \\\"4B CFU PROBIOTICS\\\", with a lower sub-bar reading \\\"Whey Protein Isolate with Natural Digestive Enzymes & Probiotics.\\\" A circular \\\"HORMONE FREE\\\" seal with a line-art cow head sits to the right of this grid, while the very bottom edge features a green vegetarian dot symbol, the word \\\"NUTRACEUTICAL\\\" (or \\\"NUTRACEUTICAL FOR ADULTS\\\"), and the net weight (labeled as either \\\"1 kg (2.2 lb)\\\" or \\\"2KG (4.4LB)\\\"). The dry product inside is a finely milled, loose, off-white to pale cream-colored powder.\\n\\nUse the product appearance text only as a private visual reference for accurately drawing the product. Do not print, quote, paraphrase, label, or turn any of that description into ad copy. Treat orientation-specific details carefully: show front-only details only when the product front is visible; if the brief shows the back, side, top, or an angled view where those details would not be visible, omit them instead of moving them onto the wrong face.\\n\\nThe attached product photos show the real product — reproduce it faithfully.\\n\\nDesign requirements (apply to this ad):\\n- Follow the instructions by the director.\\n- Make the ad design, layout, typography on-branded, but should look premium, editorial-like.\\n- Establish a clear visual hierarchy: one dominant focal point the eye lands on\\n  first, then the supporting message, then the CTA.\\n- Keep strong figure/ground contrast. If text sits over imagery, place a scrim or\\n  overlay behind it so it stays fully legible.\\n- Place the focal subject on a rule-of-thirds line; leave generous whitespace and\\n  avoid clutter.\\n- Use a limited palette anchored to the brand colors (~60-30-10), reserving one\\n  accent color for the call to action.\\n- Keep 20% space all around the creative for the ad to look cleaner\\n- Group and align elements cleanly (Gestalt); use at most two type styles.\",\"brandLogoUrl\":null,\"imageProvider\":\"openai\",\"productImageUrls\":[\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/a283cc61-8138-4e74-8189-32554920ab0b/1786870549944-a985ed83-af31-4505-9597-2040e34b2d43.jpg\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/a283cc61-8138-4e74-8189-32554920ab0b/1786870549958-a5cf5ca2-30b7-4a27-a29f-4498803081c8.jpg\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/a283cc61-8138-4e74-8189-32554920ab0b/1786870550234-77fd6628-1c8d-4097-a145-b5f729a36ee3.jpg\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/a283cc61-8138-4e74-8189-32554920ab0b/1786870550216-ed6397c1-1360-44e7-bed7-7085cf446c29.jpg\"],\"visualDescription\":\"This stand-up, gusseted resealable pouch is constructed from a flexible, semi-matte metallic silver-gray laminate foil with tear notches and a visible press-to-close zipper line near the heat-sealed top edge. The left side gusset features a vertical, high-contrast marbled pattern of fluid black, gray, and white swirls that wraps slightly onto the front face, while the upper-right corner is detailed with a solid matte white vertical strip displaying a bold black \\\"31g PROTEIN\\\" callout. Centered near the top is the cursive script \\\"Progress Series\\\" in black, positioned above a circular black logo for \\\"WELLBEING NUTRITION\\\" that encloses a stylized \\\"W\\\" with a small green leaf on its right tip. The front center displays \\\"WHEY PROTEIN\\\" (or \\\"100% WHEY PROTEIN^\\\" on some size variants) and the word \\\"ISOLATE\\\" in giant, clean, sans-serif black lettering, underscored by \\\"ULTRA PURE • FAST ABSORBING\\\". Below this, a white pill-shaped capsule badge reads \\\"UNFLAVOURED\\\" in black, followed by a black-bordered horizontal nutritional grid divided into five columns detailing \\\"31g PROTEIN\\\", \\\"15.4g EAA\\\", \\\"7.1g BCAA\\\", either \\\"1.4g CARBS\\\" or \\\"<1g CARBS\\\" depending on the packaging size, and \\\"4B CFU PROBIOTICS\\\", with a lower sub-bar reading \\\"Whey Protein Isolate with Natural Digestive Enzymes & Probiotics.\\\" A circular \\\"HORMONE FREE\\\" seal with a line-art cow head sits to the right of this grid, while the very bottom edge features a green vegetarian dot symbol, the word \\\"NUTRACEUTICAL\\\" (or \\\"NUTRACEUTICAL FOR ADULTS\\\"), and the net weight (labeled as either \\\"1 kg (2.2 lb)\\\" or \\\"2KG (4.4LB)\\\"). The dry product inside is a finely milled, loose, off-white to pale cream-colored powder.\",\"referenceImageUrls\":[\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/a283cc61-8138-4e74-8189-32554920ab0b/1786870549944-a985ed83-af31-4505-9597-2040e34b2d43.jpg\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/a283cc61-8138-4e74-8189-32554920ab0b/1786870549958-a5cf5ca2-30b7-4a27-a29f-4498803081c8.jpg\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/a283cc61-8138-4e74-8189-32554920ab0b/1786870550234-77fd6628-1c8d-4097-a145-b5f729a36ee3.jpg\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/a283cc61-8138-4e74-8189-32554920ab0b/1786870550216-ed6397c1-1360-44e7-bed7-7085cf446c29.jpg\"],\"referenceAdImageUrls\":[],\"originalReferenceImageUrls\":[\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/a283cc61-8138-4e74-8189-32554920ab0b/1786870549944-a985ed83-af31-4505-9597-2040e34b2d43.jpg\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/a283cc61-8138-4e74-8189-32554920ab0b/1786870549958-a5cf5ca2-30b7-4a27-a29f-4498803081c8.jpg\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/a283cc61-8138-4e74-8189-32554920ab0b/1786870550234-77fd6628-1c8d-4097-a145-b5f729a36ee3.jpg\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/a283cc61-8138-4e74-8189-32554920ab0b/1786870550216-ed6397c1-1360-44e7-bed7-7085cf446c29.jpg\"]},\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-16T09:01:19.122Z\",\"variations\":[{\"id\":\"8cdec82a-7211-47b8-83b8-cdfabd7090ba\",\"creativeVersionId\":\"5256a415-9cca-4004-927a-b4f831c2c522\",\"variationType\":\"size\",\"variationKey\":\"original\",\"width\":null,\"height\":null,\"aspectRatio\":null,\"platform\":null,\"isPrimary\":true,\"storageKey\":null,\"assetUrl\":null,\"thumbnailUrl\":null,\"mimeType\":null,\"downloadCount\":0,\"status\":\"generating\",\"metadata\":{\"brief\":\"This static 1:1 ad leverages the Spec-Sheet Showdown Framework to visually compare the superior nutritional metrics of Wellbeing Nutrition against standard market alternatives. The visual hero is the premium metallic silver-gray pouch with its high-contrast marbled pattern, surrounded by clean, clinical data cards with a 0.1 opacity grid. A bold table compares Standard Whey (24g Protein, 10g EAA, 0 Probiotics) directly against Our Isolate (31g Protein, 15.4g EAA, 4B Probiotics) in a clear, easy-to-read layout. The on-image headline in Circular Std is \\\"31g Protein per scoop. No fillers.\\\" The single call to action is a sharp, modern button with a radius of zero that reads \\\"Try the upgrade.\\\" Keep the creative on-brand by using a clean Mist Gray background, incorporating the Action Gradient (#ff9000 to #ff5000) for the CTA button, and using Outfit Bold for the high-contrast typography.\",\"prompt\":\"Instructions by the director: This static 1:1 ad leverages the Spec-Sheet Showdown Framework to visually compare the superior nutritional metrics of Wellbeing Nutrition against standard market alternatives. The visual hero is the premium metallic silver-gray pouch with its high-contrast marbled pattern, surrounded by clean, clinical data cards with a 0.1 opacity grid. A bold table compares Standard Whey (24g Protein, 10g EAA, 0 Probiotics) directly against Our Isolate (31g Protein, 15.4g EAA, 4B Probiotics) in a clear, easy-to-read layout. The on-image headline in Circular Std is \\\"31g Protein per scoop. No fillers.\\\" The single call to action is a sharp, modern button with a radius of zero that reads \\\"Try the upgrade.\\\" Keep the creative on-brand by using a clean Mist Gray background, incorporating the Action Gradient (#ff9000 to #ff5000) for the CTA button, and using Outfit Bold for the high-contrast typography.\\n\\nProduct appearance: This stand-up, gusseted resealable pouch is constructed from a flexible, semi-matte metallic silver-gray laminate foil with tear notches and a visible press-to-close zipper line near the heat-sealed top edge. The left side gusset features a vertical, high-contrast marbled pattern of fluid black, gray, and white swirls that wraps slightly onto the front face, while the upper-right corner is detailed with a solid matte white vertical strip displaying a bold black \\\"31g PROTEIN\\\" callout. Centered near the top is the cursive script \\\"Progress Series\\\" in black, positioned above a circular black logo for \\\"WELLBEING NUTRITION\\\" that encloses a stylized \\\"W\\\" with a small green leaf on its right tip. The front center displays \\\"WHEY PROTEIN\\\" (or \\\"100% WHEY PROTEIN^\\\" on some size variants) and the word \\\"ISOLATE\\\" in giant, clean, sans-serif black lettering, underscored by \\\"ULTRA PURE • FAST ABSORBING\\\". Below this, a white pill-shaped capsule badge reads \\\"UNFLAVOURED\\\" in black, followed by a black-bordered horizontal nutritional grid divided into five columns detailing \\\"31g PROTEIN\\\", \\\"15.4g EAA\\\", \\\"7.1g BCAA\\\", either \\\"1.4g CARBS\\\" or \\\"<1g CARBS\\\" depending on the packaging size, and \\\"4B CFU PROBIOTICS\\\", with a lower sub-bar reading \\\"Whey Protein Isolate with Natural Digestive Enzymes & Probiotics.\\\" A circular \\\"HORMONE FREE\\\" seal with a line-art cow head sits to the right of this grid, while the very bottom edge features a green vegetarian dot symbol, the word \\\"NUTRACEUTICAL\\\" (or \\\"NUTRACEUTICAL FOR ADULTS\\\"), and the net weight (labeled as either \\\"1 kg (2.2 lb)\\\" or \\\"2KG (4.4LB)\\\"). The dry product inside is a finely milled, loose, off-white to pale cream-colored powder.\\n\\nUse the product appearance text only as a private visual reference for accurately drawing the product. Do not print, quote, paraphrase, label, or turn any of that description into ad copy. Treat orientation-specific details carefully: show front-only details only when the product front is visible; if the brief shows the back, side, top, or an angled view where those details would not be visible, omit them instead of moving them onto the wrong face.\\n\\nThe attached product photos show the real product — reproduce it faithfully.\\n\\nDesign requirements (apply to this ad):\\n- Follow the instructions by the director.\\n- Make the ad design, layout, typography on-branded, but should look premium, editorial-like.\\n- Establish a clear visual hierarchy: one dominant focal point the eye lands on\\n  first, then the supporting message, then the CTA.\\n- Keep strong figure/ground contrast. If text sits over imagery, place a scrim or\\n  overlay behind it so it stays fully legible.\\n- Place the focal subject on a rule-of-thirds line; leave generous whitespace and\\n  avoid clutter.\\n- Use a limited palette anchored to the brand colors (~60-30-10), reserving one\\n  accent color for the call to action.\\n- Keep 20% space all around the creative for the ad to look cleaner\\n- Group and align elements cleanly (Gestalt); use at most two type styles.\",\"source\":\"campaign-creatives\",\"language\":\"English\",\"lastError\":null,\"imageModel\":\"openai/gpt-image-2:100\",\"hasNSFWRisk\":false,\"imagePrompt\":\"Instructions by the director: This static 1:1 ad leverages the Spec-Sheet Showdown Framework to visually compare the superior nutritional metrics of Wellbeing Nutrition against standard market alternatives. The visual hero is the premium metallic silver-gray pouch with its high-contrast marbled pattern, surrounded by clean, clinical data cards with a 0.1 opacity grid. A bold table compares Standard Whey (24g Protein, 10g EAA, 0 Probiotics) directly against Our Isolate (31g Protein, 15.4g EAA, 4B Probiotics) in a clear, easy-to-read layout. The on-image headline in Circular Std is \\\"31g Protein per scoop. No fillers.\\\" The single call to action is a sharp, modern button with a radius of zero that reads \\\"Try the upgrade.\\\" Keep the creative on-brand by using a clean Mist Gray background, incorporating the Action Gradient (#ff9000 to #ff5000) for the CTA button, and using Outfit Bold for the high-contrast typography.\\n\\nProduct appearance: This stand-up, gusseted resealable pouch is constructed from a flexible, semi-matte metallic silver-gray laminate foil with tear notches and a visible press-to-close zipper line near the heat-sealed top edge. The left side gusset features a vertical, high-contrast marbled pattern of fluid black, gray, and white swirls that wraps slightly onto the front face, while the upper-right corner is detailed with a solid matte white vertical strip displaying a bold black \\\"31g PROTEIN\\\" callout. Centered near the top is the cursive script \\\"Progress Series\\\" in black, positioned above a circular black logo for \\\"WELLBEING NUTRITION\\\" that encloses a stylized \\\"W\\\" with a small green leaf on its right tip. The front center displays \\\"WHEY PROTEIN\\\" (or \\\"100% WHEY PROTEIN^\\\" on some size variants) and the word \\\"ISOLATE\\\" in giant, clean, sans-serif black lettering, underscored by \\\"ULTRA PURE • FAST ABSORBING\\\". Below this, a white pill-shaped capsule badge reads \\\"UNFLAVOURED\\\" in black, followed by a black-bordered horizontal nutritional grid divided into five columns detailing \\\"31g PROTEIN\\\", \\\"15.4g EAA\\\", \\\"7.1g BCAA\\\", either \\\"1.4g CARBS\\\" or \\\"<1g CARBS\\\" depending on the packaging size, and \\\"4B CFU PROBIOTICS\\\", with a lower sub-bar reading \\\"Whey Protein Isolate with Natural Digestive Enzymes & Probiotics.\\\" A circular \\\"HORMONE FREE\\\" seal with a line-art cow head sits to the right of this grid, while the very bottom edge features a green vegetarian dot symbol, the word \\\"NUTRACEUTICAL\\\" (or \\\"NUTRACEUTICAL FOR ADULTS\\\"), and the net weight (labeled as either \\\"1 kg (2.2 lb)\\\" or \\\"2KG (4.4LB)\\\"). The dry product inside is a finely milled, loose, off-white to pale cream-colored powder.\\n\\nUse the product appearance text only as a private visual reference for accurately drawing the product. Do not print, quote, paraphrase, label, or turn any of that description into ad copy. Treat orientation-specific details carefully: show front-only details only when the product front is visible; if the brief shows the back, side, top, or an angled view where those details would not be visible, omit them instead of moving them onto the wrong face.\\n\\nThe attached product photos show the real product — reproduce it faithfully.\\n\\nDesign requirements (apply to this ad):\\n- Follow the instructions by the director.\\n- Make the ad design, layout, typography on-branded, but should look premium, editorial-like.\\n- Establish a clear visual hierarchy: one dominant focal point the eye lands on\\n  first, then the supporting message, then the CTA.\\n- Keep strong figure/ground contrast. If text sits over imagery, place a scrim or\\n  overlay behind it so it stays fully legible.\\n- Place the focal subject on a rule-of-thirds line; leave generous whitespace and\\n  avoid clutter.\\n- Use a limited palette anchored to the brand colors (~60-30-10), reserving one\\n  accent color for the call to action.\\n- Keep 20% space all around the creative for the ad to look cleaner\\n- Group and align elements cleanly (Gestalt); use at most two type styles.\",\"brandLogoUrl\":null,\"imageProvider\":\"openai\",\"productImageUrls\":[\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/a283cc61-8138-4e74-8189-32554920ab0b/1786870549944-a985ed83-af31-4505-9597-2040e34b2d43.jpg\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/a283cc61-8138-4e74-8189-32554920ab0b/1786870549958-a5cf5ca2-30b7-4a27-a29f-4498803081c8.jpg\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/a283cc61-8138-4e74-8189-32554920ab0b/1786870550234-77fd6628-1c8d-4097-a145-b5f