r Sans reads \\\"Protein that doesn't cause bloating.\\\" The target audience consists of active individuals who love whey but suffer from digestive distress. The clear call to action is a pill-shaped button that reads \\\"See the difference.\\\" To ensure the design is on-brand, set it against a soothing Wellness Cream (#fff9eb) background, use Outfit for the small nutritional callouts detailing the 4 Billion CFU probiotics, and anchor the CTA with the Action Gradient.\",\"prompt\":\"Instructions by the director: This static 1:1 image uses the Problem-Agitate-Solve (PAS) Framework to address the bloating and digestive discomfort caused by standard protein powders. The visual hero is a clean, minimal side-by-side illustration: one side shows a stressed, bloated silhouette, while the other side features a calm, serene silhouette glowing with a gentle Organic Green light around the gut area, positioned beside our premium UNFLAVOURED silver pouch. The on-image headline in elegant Tenor Sans reads \\\"Protein that doesn't cause bloating.\\\" The target audience consists of active individuals who love whey but suffer from digestive distress. The clear call to action is a pill-shaped button that reads \\\"See the difference.\\\" To ensure the design is on-brand, set it against a soothing Wellness Cream (#fff9eb) background, use Outfit for the small nutritional callouts detailing the 4 Billion CFU probiotics, and anchor the CTA with the Action Gradient.\\n\\nProduct appearance: This stand-up, gusseted resealable pouch is constructed from a flexible, semi-matte metallic silver-gray laminate foil with tear notches and a visible press-to-close zipper line near the heat-sealed top edge. The left side gusset features a vertical, high-contrast marbled pattern of fluid black, gray, and white swirls that wraps slightly onto the front face, while the upper-right corner is detailed with a solid matte white vertical strip displaying a bold black \\\"31g PROTEIN\\\" callout. Centered 