cts.\\\" This directly targets premium-seeking fitness enthusiasts looking to upgrade their post-workout routine. The call to action is a sharp-angled Premium Black button that reads \\\"Compare the purity.\\\" To maintain brand alignment, use a clean Mist Gray background with a faint diagonal grid overlay at 0.1 opacity, employing our high-energy Primary Brand Orange (#ff5000) for highlighting key text.\",\"prompt\":\"Instructions by the director: This static 1:1 graphic utilizes the Contrast Framework to position our premium isolate against standard whey. The visual is split vertically: on the left, a dull, clumpy, brown-tinted shake represents standard cheese by-product whey with a subtle gray cross; on the right, our finely milled, pale cream-colored powder mixes effortlessly into water, next to the sleek, metallic silver-gray pouch. The on-image headline in bold Circular Std reads \\\"Stop drinking cheese by-products.\\\" This directly targets premium-seeking fitness enthusiasts looking to upgrade their post-workout routine. The call to action is a sharp-angled Premium Black button that reads \\\"Compare the purity.\\\" To maintain brand alignment, use a clean Mist Gray background with a faint diagonal grid overlay at 0.1 opacity, employing our high-energy Primary Brand Orange (#ff5000) for highlighting key text.\\n\\nProduct appearance: This stand-up, gusseted resealable pouch is constructed from a flexible, semi-matte metallic silver-gray laminate foil with tear notches and a visible press-to-close zipper line near the heat-sealed top edge. The left side gusset features a vertical, high-contrast marbled pattern of fluid black, gray, and white swirls that wraps slightly onto the front face, while the upper-right corner is detailed with a solid matte white vertical strip displaying a bold black \\\"31g PROTEIN\\\" callout. Centered near the top is the cursive script \\\"Progress Series\\\" in black, positioned above a circular black logo for \\\"WELLBEING NUTRI