, next to the sleek, metallic silver-gray pouch. The on-image headline in bold Circular Std reads \\\"Stop drinking cheese by-products.\\\" This directly targets premium-seeking fitness enthusiasts looking to upgrade their post-workout routine. The call to action is a sharp-angled Premium Black button that reads \\\"Compare the purity.\\\" To maintain brand alignment, use a clean Mist Gray background with a faint diagonal grid overlay at 0.1 opacity, employing our high-energy Primary Brand Orange (#ff5000) for highlighting key text.\\n\\nProduct appearance: This stand-up, gusseted resealable pouch is constructed from a flexible, semi-matte metallic silver-gray laminate foil with tear notches and a visible press-to-close zipper line near the heat-sealed top edge. The left side gusset features a vertical, high-contrast marbled pattern of fluid black, gray, and white swirls that wraps slightly onto the front face, while the upper-right corner is detailed with a solid matte white vertical strip displaying a bold black \\\"31g PROTEIN\\\" callout. Centered near the top is the cursive script \\\"Progress Series\\\" in black, positioned above a circular black logo for \\\"WELLBEING NUTRITION\\\" that encloses a stylized \\\"W\\\" with a small green leaf on its right tip. The front center displays \\\"WHEY PROTEIN\\\" (or \\\"100% WHEY PROTEIN^\\\" on some size variants) and the word \\\"ISOLATE\\\" in giant, clean, sans-serif black lettering, underscored by \\\"ULTRA PURE • FAST ABSORBING\\\". Below this, a white pill-shaped capsule badge reads \\\"UNFLAVOURED\\\" in black, followed by a black-bordered horizontal nutritional grid divided into five columns detailing \\\"31g PROTEIN\\\", \\\"15.4g EAA\\\", \\\"7.1g BCAA\\\", either \\\"1.4g CARBS\\\" or \\\"<1g CARBS\\\" depending on the packaging size, and \\\"4B CFU PROBIOTICS\\\", with a lower sub-bar reading \\\"Whey Protein Isolate with Natural Digestive Enzymes & Probiotics.\\\" A circular \\\"HORMONE FREE\\\" seal wit